From db7b35e45c641af64058379f3a679522d26f9396 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:14:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: rogue stealth travel, melee caution, trainer chosen by
 what it teaches (F-219)

- CombatState.auras (our visible auras)
- a rogue stealths before trips over 60 yd (a toggle: never while it is up);
  its deaths were packs jumping it on the road
- melee classes: routes refused past mobs 2+ levels up (was 3+), quests at
  most 1 level above us (was 2)
- train(): the nearest trainer that has something learnable, not just the
  nearest (Sunstrider's rogue trainer stops at level 6; Sprint and Slice and
  Dice are in Falconwing Square / Silvermoon); the far-walk rule uses the
  chosen trainer's distance

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
